'''''Frangula azorica''''' is a tall [[semi-deciduous]] shrub or small tree in the family [[Rhamnaceae]].<ref>{{cite web |last1=Dias |first1=Eduardo |last2=Araújo |first2=Carina |last3=Mendes |first3=José Fernando |last4=Elias |first4=Rui |last5=Mendes |first5=Cândida |last6=Melo |first6=Cecília |title=Espécies Florestais das ilhas |url=http://almanaqueacoriano.com/images//biblioteca//Estudo%20-%20Esp%C3%A9cies%20Florestais%20das%20ilhas.pdf |publisher=Almanaque Açoriano |access-date=28 December 2021}}</ref> It is [[endemic]] to the [[Azores]], [[Portugal]]. Fossil evidence suggests this species was also native to [[Madeira]] but went extinct.<ref>{{cite web |title=Espécies da Directiva Habitats 140/49 Diário da Republica Anexo II: Frangula azorica |url=http://www.ibigbiology.com/fotos/publicacoes/publicacoes_Frangula_azorica_EspeciesDirectivaAvesHabitatsAnexoII.pdf |publisher=ibigbiology.com |access-date=27 December 2021}}</ref> It is threatened by [[habitat loss]].<ref name="iucn status 17 November 2021" />

